        "detailed_description": "<strong>Phobic Nightmares</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you're investigating your sister's disappearance.<br>Find notes from your sister and her team to find out exactly what happened, and why.<br>P.S.: It's not pleasant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/6e64e5acfec828e8694549593ad4f18c.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=35 /></span><br>Face increasingly difficult challenges as the entity that you're facing keeps altering the environment. You haven't felt real dread till now.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/fa1d263d704e8efc2d8f16429ae3539c.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>You're looking for your sister, and your biggest fear is becoming true. She went inside the forbidden abandoned mansion. Explore the mansion and it's surroundings to find out what's so truly wrong with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/1ce534f26a04277e0a9854f3d7e35fe4.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>​Multiple rituals. Multiple paths. Discover new horrors of the story each time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/20bd5ee64d8a9a946294e291ef76cca2.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>The game is made with realistic graphics and immersive audios in mind, but most importantly, the behavior of the supernatural entity is what makes real horror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: You're obligated to leave this page if you can't stomach true horror.",
        "about_the_game": "<strong>Phobic Nightmares</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game where you're investigating your sister's disappearance.<br>Find notes from your sister and her team to find out exactly what happened, and why.<br>P.S.: It's not pleasant.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/6e64e5acfec828e8694549593ad4f18c.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=35 /></span><br>Face increasingly difficult challenges as the entity that you're facing keeps altering the environment. You haven't felt real dread till now.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/4c2b1bc1e4c669a05724edb33411199c.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/fa1d263d704e8efc2d8f16429ae3539c.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>You're looking for your sister, and your biggest fear is becoming true. She went inside the forbidden abandoned mansion. Explore the mansion and it's surroundings to find out what's so truly wrong with it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/698b1d709a488233bf77c7b2b2155b59.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/1ce534f26a04277e0a9854f3d7e35fe4.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>​Multiple rituals. Multiple paths. Discover new horrors of the story each time you play.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/8e17475a4ffdbf812d6b2989b1caa6bd.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/20bd5ee64d8a9a946294e291ef76cca2.webp?t=1769442683\" width=338 height=30 /></span><br>The game is made with realistic graphics and immersive audios in mind, but most importantly, the behavior of the supernatural entity is what makes real horror.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.poster.avif?t=1769442683\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.webm?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196740/extras/55db33d8e6ceb1e3731e3f6ef544b623.mp4?t=1769442683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Disclaimer</strong>: You're obligated to leave this page if you can't stomach true horror.",
